Task 9. New route app/swatch-box/page.tsx. The hero CTA added in
commit 63607a6 points at /swatch-box/ and has 404'd since; this fixes it.

All copy is verbatim from the brief: H1 "The Swatch Box", the $45 price
with "Credited in full to your order. Ships in 2 business days.", the
body paragraph, the four "What's inside" items, and both named sections
(The Colour Match Promise, For your bridesmaids).

CTA is `Order your Swatch Box — $45` with href="#" and the specified
TODO(owner) comment, exactly as instructed — deliberately NOT wired to
anything. Repeated once more in a closing CTA, same href and comment.

Added page metadata, plus BreadcrumbList and Service JSON-LD.
Registered in app/sitemap.ts and in the footer Company nav, as required.

Inline styles plus the Tailwind utilities already used in the repo. No
new classes, no dependencies, no UI library.

Verified: npx tsc --noEmit exit 0.
